A||||6||2FAST4U||A note from Santa||||1||
Z||000000||2FAST4U||12-23-1999||04:21 PM||||I regret to inform you that, effective immediatly, I will no longer be able to serve the United States on Christmas. Due to the population of the earth, my contract was renegotiated by North American Faries and Elves Local 209. I now serve only certian areas of the Northen Hemisphere.<BR>However I am certain that your children will be in good hands with your local replacement who just happens to be my third cousin, Bubba Claus. His side of the family is from the South Pole. He shares my goal of delivering toys to all of the girls and boys, however there are a few differences between us. They are as follows:<BR>There is no chance of the Grinch steeling your presents from Bubba Claus. He has a gun rack on his sleigh and a bumper sticker that reads "These toys protected by Smith & Wesson.<BR>Instead of milk and cookies, Bubba Claus prefers that you leave an RC cola and pork rinds or a moon pie.<BR>And Bubba Claus doesn't smoke a pipe. He dips a little snuff, so please have an empty spitcan handy.<BR>Bubba Claus' sleigh is pulled by floppy eared flying 'coon dogs instead if reindeer. I made the mistake of lending him a couple of my reindeer one time and Blitzen's head now overlooks Bubba's fireplace.<BR>You won't hear " On Comet, on Cupid, on Donner and Blitzen" when Bubba Claus arrives. Instead you will hear " On Earnhardt, on Wallace, On Martin and Labonte. On Rudd, on Jarret, on Elliot and Petty".<BR>Ho Ho Ho hase been replace by "Yee Haw" and you are also likely to hear the elves respond with "I her'd dat"<BR>As required by Southern highway laws, Bubba Claus' sleigh does have a Yosemite Sam safty triangle with the words "Back off" in the rear. The last I heard it also had other decorations as well. A Fiero emblem with lights that race through it. and a Caricature of me Santa Claus going wee wee on a rice burner.<BR>The usual Christmas movies classics such as "Mirical on 34th Street" and It's a Wonderful Life" will not be shown in your negotiated area. Instead you will see "Boss Hogg Saves Christmas" and Smokey and the Bandit IV" featuring Burt Rynolds and thousands of state patrol cars crashing into each other. <BR>Bubba Clause doesn't wear a belt so if I was you I'd make sure the wife and kids were turned the other way when he bemds over to place gifts under the tree.<BR>And finally, lovely Christmas songs about me like "Rudolph The Red Nosed Reindeer" and Bing Crosby's "Santa Claus Is Comming to Town" will not be heard this year<BR>Insted, this year songs about Bubba Claus will be played over the AM radio. These songs will include. Mark Chestnuts "Bubba Claus Shot the Jukebox", Cledius T. Judd's "All I Want for Christmas is my Woman and a Six Pack", and Hank William Jr's " If You Don't Like Bubba Clause, You Can Shove It"<P>Sincerely Yours<P>Santa Claus (member Local 209 NAF&EL)<p>[This message has been edited by 2FAST4U (edited 12-23-1999).]||||reg||1
